WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.242
Is something right just because

2
00:00:02.242 --> 00:00:03.217
it's legal?

3
00:00:03.217 --> 00:00:05.031
Ethics asks a bigger question

4
00:00:05.031 --> 00:00:06.722
than the law does.

5
00:00:07.046 --> 00:00:08.691
Law tells you the minimum

6
00:00:08.691 --> 00:00:09.810
you must do.

7
00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:11.498
Ethics asks what is right,

8
00:00:11.498 --> 00:00:12.832
even where the law is

9
00:00:12.832 --> 00:00:13.807
silent.

10
00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.181
Look at the intention behind

11
00:00:16.181 --> 00:00:16.744
an act,

12
00:00:16.744 --> 00:00:18.211
and the means used.

13
00:00:18.211 --> 00:00:19.837
And at its consequences,

14
00:00:19.837 --> 00:00:21.735
for everyone affected.

15
00:00:22.078 --> 00:00:23.964
Gandhi held that good ends

16
00:00:23.964 --> 00:00:25.967
never justify bad means.

17
00:00:25.967 --> 00:00:27.230
He said the means are

18
00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:28.055
like a seed,

19
00:00:28.055 --> 00:00:28.879
and the end,

20
00:00:28.879 --> 00:00:29.972
the tree.

21
00:00:30.645 --> 00:00:31.916
Your turn.

22
00:00:31.916 --> 00:00:33.422
How are law and ethics

23
00:00:33.422 --> 00:00:34.430
linked?
